            "review_title": "Review at The ACE Club",
            "review_text": "Ray Ray Ray\nDubai, United Arab Emirates936 contributions\n0\nA good choice but you have to watch service or the bill keeps climbing.\nJan 2023 • Friends\nVINA house club with dancey dancey girls and DJ. Super primitive form of Vietnamese entertainment from days gone by.\n\nShisha 350k is ok although VINA house club with dancey dancey girls and DJ. Super primitive form of Vietnamese entertainment from days gone by.\n\nShisha 350k is ok although you have to watch service or the bill keeps climbing. (Refill Shisha heads, extra water, etc.)\n\nThe sit down cocktail bar at the end of the club is just for show. Too much clutter to make it comfortable and the drink program is questionable.\n\nSound levels register between 86 dB and 100 dB so do ensure to protect yourself. It’s still fun!\n\nBathrooms are medieval, watch your step, especially puddles.\n\nStick with beer or water, you’ll be fine. Five stars because this place is what it is.. (Refill Shisha heads, extra water, etc.)\n\nThe sit down cocktail bar at the end of the club is just for show. Too much clutter to make it comfortable and the drink program is questionable.\n\nSound levels register between 86 dB and 100 dB so do ensure to protect yourself. It’s still fun!\n\nBathrooms are medieval, watch your step, especially puddles.\n\nStick with beer or water, you’ll be fine. Five stars because this place is what it is.\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nWritten April 9, 2023",
